22/09/2026 - DAY 1
03:31

Today I learned about the UI for Cisco Packet Tracer and how to use it

With it, I have created a basic Smart House Network which has the following end Devices

Generic Laptop
2. Generic PC
3. Gaming PC
4. Mascom WIFI Router
5. Security Camera
6. Air Conditioner
7. Coffee Maker
8. JBL Speaker
9. House Light

CONNECTIONS

WIRELESS - Generic Laptop, Smart Tablet Control

BLUETOOTH - Air Conditioner, JBL Speaker, House Light

PORTS - Gaming PC, Generic PC, Home Security Camera


I replaced the Laptop port module with the Linksys-WPC300N module which offers wireless connectivity
#IMPORTANT LESSON
ALWAYS TURN DEVICES OFF BEFORE CONFIGURATION
